JubilifeCity_JubilifeTV_F3_Text_Npc2:
	.string "I just realized something awesome!\nI should be trading Pokémon more!\pThe more trades I make, the better my\nodds of winning the Pokémon Lottery!\pWhy? Because the ID No. of a Pokémon\nis different from Trainer to Trainer!$"

